# Service: COOLIFY FRONTEND SERVICE (React / Vite)
# Container Port: 80
# Exposed Domain: https://YOUR_DOMAIN.com
#
# CRITICAL SECURITY NOTE:
# Never put MSG91 credentials, database credentials, or secret keys here.
